  "prefLabel": "Puc 204.28 Investigations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 204.28 Investigations. If it appears to the commission that any public utility or other matter within its jurisdiction requires investigation, the commission shall conduct an independent investigation pursuant to RSA 365:5.\n\nSource. #14184, eff 1-24-25 (formerly Puc 204.04)",
